# VS Code REST Client file. Start the API first (make services, make dev, or make up).
# Seed ids: PAMP = 47, METR = 54, BMA = 31, PGR (no market data) = 3, ARS = 66.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Portfolio of user 1 (total 904784.00)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/portfolio

### Portfolio of a user without orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/2/portfolio

### Portfolio: unknown user (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999/portfolio

### Portfolio: invalid user id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/abc/portfolio

### Search instruments
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=pamp

### Search instruments with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=a&limit=5&offset=5

### Search: missing q (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments

### Search: limit out of range (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?q=pamp&limit=500

### MARKET buy by size
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 2 }

### MARKET buy by amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 5000 }

### MARKET sell
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### LIMIT buy (stays NEW and reserves pesos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 1, "price": 900 }

### LIMIT sell (stays NEW and reserves shares)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 1, "price": 1000 }

### Rejected: not enough pesos (201, status REJECTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 100000 }

### Rejected: not enough shares (201, status REJECTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 100000 }

### Cash in
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "side": "CASH_IN", "amount": 100000 }

### Cash in with cents (size answers "2777.55")
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "side": "CASH_IN", "amount": "2777.55" }

### Transfer sent with size (400: transfers take pesos in amount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "side": "CASH_IN", "size": 100 }

### Cash out
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "side": "CASH_OUT", "amount": 1000 }

### Retry with the same Idempotency-Key (returns the same order)
# Replace the key with one of your own and send this request twice.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: 5b3f1c1e-9f0a-4c1d-8a55-2f4e6d7c8b90
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 3, "side": "CASH_IN", "amount": 500 }

### Same key, different body (422)
# Send after the previous request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: 5b3f1c1e-9f0a-4c1d-8a55-2f4e6d7c8b90
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 3, "side": "CASH_IN", "amount": 900 }

### Missing Idempotency-Key (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### Idempotency-Key is not a UUID (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: not-a-uuid
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### Missing fields (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "side": "BUY" }

### size and amount together (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1, "amount": 1000 }

### Neither size nor amount (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET" }

### Size of zero (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 0 }

### Fractional share size (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1.5 }

### LIMIT without price (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 1 }

### MARKET with price (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1, "price": 900 }

### Unknown user (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 999, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### Unknown instrument (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 9999, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### BUY on the ARS instrument (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 66, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### MARKET on an instrument without market data (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 3, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1 }

### Amount too small for one share (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 100 }

### Cancel an order (use the id of a NEW order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel

### Cancel: unknown order (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/999999/cancel

### Cancel: invalid id (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/abc/cancel

### Cancel an order that is not NEW (409)
# Order 1 of the seed is FILLED.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel

### Prometheus metrics (orders_total, request latency, consumer metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
